Replace "" with NULL for product revision level, and merge TEXEL
duplicate entries.

Cc: Hannes Reinecke <hare@suse.de>
Cc: Martin K. Petersen <martin.petersen@oracle.com>
Cc: James E.J. Bottomley <jejb@linux.vnet.ibm.com>
